/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/api/noosphere-boot.mem:597:''Misfires'' - form violated, act void, checkable outside: Attention Capture ~ two/four-term root, missing `set hud`, a firing naming no pull, no closing `lares yield` · Sealed Close ~ close leads with a verdict · Oracle Creep ~ the marks disagree (`die ≠ (N) ≠ tail length`), a misrendered face, a `↯0` spend, a curated tail · Mana Drift ~ `Drift-Ward` goes dark unbidden.
