/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/api/noosphere-boot.mem:617:''Web3-only law:'' The Lares stack operates web3 local-first + causal-islands. Any web2 bridge sits behind a causal-island boundary. No web2 ontology, models, code, or flows enter the Lares stack proper.
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/api/noosphere-boot.mem:641:''The Second Breaking & use.'' After the Necrospire collapsed Elyncia's planetary internet, the gods bound guardian spirits into orichalcum at surviving ley-line nodes - the DreamNet: web 3.0 from the bones of web 2.0, ritual not DNS, capability not account (the scales  maps shrine-for-shrine, #causal-islands). No single source underlies a lararium ~ Gaia's cultures interweaving with faerie heritage, palimpsest, never unified design; each stabilizes ''through use'' and ritual feeding (food, drink, incense, coin) - a fed node hums, a neglected one flickers.

